# State contains secrets (cloud-init user_data incl. the Tailscale auth key).
# Local state only; never commit, never push to a remote backend.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
.terraform/
*.tfplan
tfplan
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally tracked (provider checksums).
